<title>RUSSIA: Russia central bank stays away from govt paper mkt.</title>
<headline>Russia central bank stays away from govt paper mkt.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian central bank did not intervene on the government securities market on behalf of the Finance Ministry on Monday, the bank's open-market operations department said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
